 This sand bank is a good place for children. Every fine day Neddy takes his toys and goes to the sand bank. I see him and think he is a nice clean boy. He wears a linen shirt, a hat with blue ribbon, white socks, and buttoned boots. After a few hours he comes back looking like a wild boy.

